          </tr>
        ))}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <p class="note-line">
    Sources: GATE 2027 official site (IIT Madras); UPSC ESE 2027 notice as reported by Careers360; UPSC civil services 2026 prelims figures as reported by IAS Gyan; CAT 2026 details as reported by Physics Wallah; PSU post counts as reported by Careers360; visa figures as reported by Business Today. Dates can change, so confirm them on the official site before you plan.
  </p>

  <h2 id="branch">Your branch changes which doors are cheap</h2>

  <p>
    Branch is context, not destiny. It changes which entrance exams you can write, which skills are one step away, and which jobs value your coursework. Open the guide for your own branch to go deeper, and use this page to choose the route.
  </p>

  <div class="link-grid">
